@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:18080

### 1. Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. Request the protected resource and inspect 402 + Payment-Needed
GET {{baseUrl}}/paid-resource
Accept: application/json

### 3. Retry with an explicitly fake proof; preview must still return 402
GET {{baseUrl}}/paid-resource
Accept: application/json
Payment-Proof: NON_PAYABLE_FAKE_PROOF
